_struct_biol.details               
;THE CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC ASYMMETRIC UNIT OF THIS STRUCTURE
CONTAINS TWO HOMOLOGOUS, BUT DIFFERENT, POLYPEPTIDE CHAINS
WHICH ARE DESIGNATED LIGHT (L) AND HEAVY (H).
COORDINATES OF WATER MOLECULES (W) ARE INCLUDED.  THESE
